    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM BUDDIES RETURNS\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>War has never been this fun! \u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The craziest action and strategy game is back, remastered with new features and game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic <strong>Team Buddies</strong> returns fully remastered for Steam, bringing an explosive mix of action, strategy, and multiplayer chaos. Assemble your team, equip them with devastating weapons, and unleash mayhem in frantic battles against players from around the world or in an epic single-player campaign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only rule is: <strong>build, equip, and destroy!</strong> Gather resources, combine crates to create new weapons and units, and plan your strategy to wipe out enemy bases across more than 30 unique scenarios filled with challenges, traps, and real-time destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/1b60471d4f07fce78eec3eb4e59098e0.poster.avif?t=1740066236\" width=498 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/1b60471d4f07fce78eec3eb4e59098e0.webm?t=1740066236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/1b60471d4f07fce78eec3eb4e59098e0.mp4?t=1740066236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Features and Functions:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic or Remastered Graphics Mode</strong> \u2013 Switch between the original version or enhanced 4K visuals with optimized graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Mode</strong> \u2013 Play with friends and foes in intense multiplayer battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Reborn Mode (Online)</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a revamped experience with larger maps, an expanded weapon selection, and even more frenetic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved AI, Trophies, and Achievements</strong> \u2013 Face more challenging enemies and unlock exclusive rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more! <br> <br><strong>Ready for battle? Assemble your team and prove who rules the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/81fbd3ea235327e37b00766306ceb9e6.poster.avif?t=1740066236\" width=220 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/81fbd3ea235327e37b00766306ceb9e6.webm?t=1740066236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/81fbd3ea235327e37b00766306ceb9e6.mp4?t=1740066236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The Battle Awaits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your team is in your hands. In <strong>Team Buddies</strong>, every match is a unique blend of strategy, action, and teamwork. From the moment crates start falling from the sky, the gameplay becomes <strong>fast-paced and addictive</strong>. The key is knowing <strong>when to build, what weapons to craft, and how to attack or defend</strong> to maintain the upper hand over your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level begins with <strong>a team of small but deadly warriors</strong>, ready to pick up and stack crates. Depending on how you combine them, you can craft <strong>pistols, rifles, rocket launchers, armored vehicles, and even powerful battle mechs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>defend their base, coordinate attacks, and take control of key points on the map</strong> while dealing with explosions, gunfights, and unpredictable strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to lead your team to victory?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your strategy, experiment with weapon combinations, <strong>destroy enemy bases, and prove that you are the king of the battlefield</strong>. War has never been this crazy\u2026 or this fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM BUDDIES RETURNS\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>War has never been this fun! \u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The craziest action and strategy game is back, remastered with new features and game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic <strong>Team Buddies</strong> returns fully remastered for Steam, bringing an explosive mix of action, strategy, and multiplayer chaos. Assemble your team, equip them with devastating weapons, and unleash mayhem in frantic battles against players from around the world or in an epic single-player campaign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only rule is: <strong>build, equip, and destroy!</strong> Gather resources, combine crates to create new weapons and units, and plan your strategy to wipe out enemy bases across more than 30 unique scenarios filled with challenges, traps, and real-time destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/1b60471d4f07fce78eec3eb4e59098e0.poster.avif?t=1740066236\" width=498 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/1b60471d4f07fce78eec3eb4e59098e0.webm?t=1740066236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521810/extras/1b60471d4f07fce78eec3eb4e59098e0.mp4?t=1740066236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Features and Functions:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic or Remastered Graphics Mode</strong> \u2013 Switch between the original version or enhanced 4K visuals with optimized graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Mode</strong> \u2013 Play